(772, 221, 'ceo_middle_text', '<strong>Dear valued visitor and customer,</strong>\r\n\r\nWelcome to THE Group’s new website, inspired by you and made for you.\r\n\r\nAs a Jordanian-rooted company catering to the regional market with the best quality, THE Group is viewed as a major player in the retail business. What began as a supermarket and a fashion department store, aimed at providing a revolutionized shopping experience, has now grown into a multi-faceted company that meets the everyday needs of the Jordanian consumer.\r\n\r\nStanding by our values of integrity, quality, excellence, passion, care, and loyalty, we commit to greatness in all aspects of our business.'),
(773, 221, '_ceo_middle_text', 'field_68af075eab919'),
(774, 221, 'ceo_last_text', 'THE Group offers a wide variety of products and great quality through its successful brands which include: the leading premium supermarket chain: Cozmo, the exquisite home accessory store Cozmo Home, the well-known Readers Bookshop, THE Department Store (M&amp;Co., b.young, Soyaconcept, Stummer, Elegante Uomo, Pre-End, and Blend) and the Finest Toy Shop in the World, Hamleys.\r\n\r\nI invite you to discover THE Group and gain a deeper insight into what we have to offer as a retail company in both the local and regional markets.\r\n\r\nWarmest regards,'),
(775, 221, '_ceo_last_text', 'field_68af0766ab91a'),
