(1884, 23, 'inline_featured_image', ''),
(1886, 303, 'footnotes', ''),
(1888, 23, 'main_title', 'Our Environmental Commitment'),
(1889, 23, '_main_title', 'field_68af22cbd3da7'),
(1890, 23, 'description', 'Driven by our belief that safeguarding the environment is a shared responsibility, <strong>THE Group</strong> is committed to driving positive change across all aspects of our business.\r\nOver the years, we have implemented a range of initiatives aimed at reducing our carbon footprint, championing the importance of recycling, and supporting community-focused efforts.\r\nOur journey began in 2003 with a small step: introducing a recycling programme with just three bins. A decade later, that initiative evolved into a fully operational recycling centre — a testament to our long-term commitment to sustainability.\r\nOur dedication extends to every part of our operations:\r\n• Energy-efficient LED lighting across our stores\r\n• Eco-friendly, biodegradable shopping bags\r\n• Workplace practices designed to reduce waste and conserve resources\r\nIn our most ambitious step yet, we launched our <strong>first renewable energy station</strong>, now fully operational. This milestone represents a major stride forward in minimising our environmental impact and shaping a cleaner future.\r\nAt THE Group, sustainability isn’t just a goal — it’s a responsibility we proudly uphold.'),
(1891, 23, '_description', 'field_68af22f8d3da8'),
(1892, 23, 'main_image', '127'),
(1893, 23, '_main_image', 'field_68af2319d3da9'),
(1894, 303, 'small_banner', '0'),
(1895, 303, '_small_banner', 'field_68af15bfa75ed'),
(1896, 303, 'description_on_title', '0'),
(1897, 303, '_description_on_title', 'field_68af1626a75ef'),
(1898, 303, 'header_description', 'Community support is at the core of our principles\r\n'),
(1899, 303, '_header_description', 'field_68af1637a75f0'),
(1900, 303, 'main_title', 'Our Corporate Social Responsibility Initiatives'),
(1901, 303, '_main_title', 'field_68af22cbd3da7'),
(1902, 303, 'description', 'At THE Group we have dedicated ourselves to protecting the environment in all aspects of our business. We first began recycling efforts in 2010 with just 3 recycling bins, but we knew there was more to do and so, within one year, we led the charge for environmental protection and opened a full-scale recycling center. Soon afterward, we established the “Watch Your Waste” program at the Children’s Museum to promote environmental awareness and responsibility for the children who will one day shape the future of our planet.\r\n\r\nOur values on protecting the environment can be seen in every facet of operation within our business, from utilizing energy-saving LED technology and biodegradable bags in our stores, to holding regular employee-training courses on eco-friendly practices in the workplace. Additionally, by next year we will have our first renewable energy station which will contribute greatly to the reduction of our carbon footprint. Together, we can make a difference and work towards a greener, cleaner Amman.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),
(1903, 303, '_description', 'field_68af22f8d3da8'),
(1904, 303, 'main_image', '127'),
(1905, 303, '_main_image', 'field_68af2319d3da9'),
