(2490, 351, 'first_section_title', 'A Story of Impeccable Quality'),
(2491, 351, '_first_section_title', 'field_68b0406e998c1'),
(2492, 351, 'first_section_description', 'With the aim of bringing something new to the Jordanian market, Cozmo opened its doors in 2003.\r\n\r\nGrowing as the leading supermarket in Amman, Cozmo caters to the needs of customers with a large variety of local and imported brands that meet the continuously increasing demands of its customers.\r\n\r\nWith an overall store size of 4,800 m2, the supermarket’s departments include a bakery, butchery, fresh produce section, deli, frozen food, healthy food, and all other general products needed for everyday use.'),
(2493, 351, '_first_section_description', 'field_68b04075998c2'),
