(2793, 388, 'main_description', 'Launched in 2019, Cozmo Home showcases a selection of kitchen appliances, tableware, and stylish home accessories, all under one roof. Located at the 7th Circle Cozmo Centre, it brings together favourite retailers like Irfan, Abdeen, Samiz, and Whole and All, delivering both quality and inspiration for your home.\r\nDesigned for those who value both function and style, Cozmo Home provides a personalised shopping experience that helps turn every space into a reflection of comfort and elegance.\r\nFor the heart of your home — choose Cozmo Home.'),
