(2867, 394, '_title_color', 'field_68b06e9218889'),
(2868, 394, 'main_title', 'Hamleys – Building Imaginations'),
(2869, 394, '_main_title', 'field_68b06e951888a'),
(2870, 394, 'small_font_size', '0'),
(2871, 394, '_small_font_size', 'field_68b06e991888b'),
(2872, 394, 'main_description', 'Since opening in 2008, Hamleys Jordan has proudly led the toy retail market, becoming the ultimate destination for fun, imagination, and world-class toys. Step inside and discover not only a wide selection of much-loved Hamleys toys, but also an unparalleled range from more than 200 official international toy brands — from global favourites to the latest must-haves.\r\nWith three well-positioned branches across Amman — at 7th Circle Cozmo Centre, Abdoun, and Dabouq — Hamleys has become a trusted favourite for families and gift-givers alike.\r\nExpanding beyond Jordan, Hamleys also operates four branches in Egypt, bringing the same magic, excitement, and world-class toy selection to families across the country.\r\nAs the leading toy retailer in Jordan, Hamleys continues to grow its presence and inspire young minds, offering a magical shopping experience where every visit sparks wonder, joy, and endless possibilities.\r\nMore than toys. It’s where imagination begins.'),
