(3174, 16, 'main_description', '<h2>Join Our Team</h2>\r\nAt THE Group, we believe in growing together. We are always looking for passionate, driven individuals to join our dynamic team across our diverse range of brands.\r\nIf you are ready to take the next step in your career, we\'d love to hear from you.\r\nEmail us at <span style=\"color: #d5a74e;\"><a style=\"color: #d5a74e;\" href=\"mailto:careers@thegroup.jo\"><strong>careers@thegroup.jo</strong></a></span> and let us start the conversation.\r\nYour future starts here.');
