(3196, 414, 'main_description', '<strong>Join Our Team</strong>\r\n\r\nAt <strong>THE Group</strong>, we believe in growing together. We are always looking for passionate, driven individuals to join our dynamic team across our diverse range of brands.\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to take the next step in your career, we\'d love to hear from you.\r\n\r\n<strong>Email us at</strong> <a href=\"mailto:careers@thegroup.jo\">careers@thegroup.jo</a> and let us start the conversation.\r\n\r\nYour future starts here.'),
