(3369, 435, 'right_sub_title', '<p style=\"text-align: left;\">THE Card is your key to exclusive benefits across all THE Group brands. Earn points every time you shop at Cozmo, THE Department Store, Hamleys, Readers Bookshop, and Cozmo Home. Redeem your points for <strong><span style=\"color: #d5a74e;\">vouchers to spend across all brands</span></strong> and enjoy exclusive promotions, special offers, and unique privileges with our partners — including Marriott Hotels in Jordan. Because loyalty deserves to be rewarded.</p>'),
