(3484, 438, '_ceo_image', 'field_68af0757ab918'),
(3485, 438, 'ceo_middle_text', '<strong>Dear Valued Visitor and Customer,</strong>\r\n\r\nWelcome to THE Group’s new website — designed with you in mind.\r\n\r\nRooted in Jordan and proudly serving the regional market, THE Group has grown to become a key player in the retail industry. What began as a single supermarket and fashion department store with a vision to redefine the shopping experience has evolved into a multi-brand company that caters to the everyday needs of the modern consumer.\r\n\r\nGuided by our core values — <strong>integrity, quality, excellence, passion, care, and loyalty</strong> — we remain committed to excellence across every aspect of our business.'),
(3486, 438, '_ceo_middle_text', 'field_68af075eab919'),
(3487, 438, 'ceo_last_text', 'Today, THE Group encompasses a diverse portfolio of trusted brands, including:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cozmo</strong> – Jordan’s leading premium supermarket</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Cozmo Home</strong> – a refined destination for home accessories and kitchenware</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Readers Bookshop</strong> – the go-to store for books, stationery, and educational tools</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>THE Department Store</strong> – featuring fashion brands like OVS, Piombo, Les Copains, CROFF, Pre-End, Dorina, Harmony Homewear, and Heat Holders.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Hamleys</strong> – the Finest Toy Shop in the World</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nI invite you to explore THE Group, get to know our brands, and discover the quality and care we bring to every retail experience — both locally and across the region.\r\n\r\n<strong>Warm regards,</strong>'),
(3488, 438, '_ceo_last_text', 'field_68af0766ab91a'),
