(3755, 445, '_header_description', 'field_68af1637a75f0'),
(3756, 445, 'main_title', 'Our Environmental Commitment'),
(3757, 445, '_main_title', 'field_68af22cbd3da7'),
(3758, 445, 'description', 'Driven by our belief that safeguarding the environment is a shared responsibility, THE Group is committed to driving positive change across all aspects of our business.\r\nOver the years, we have implemented a range of initiatives aimed at reducing our carbon footprint, championing the importance of recycling, and supporting community-focused efforts.\r\nOur journey began in 2003 with a small step: introducing a recycling programme with just three bins. A decade later, that initiative evolved into a fully operational recycling centre — a testament to our long-term commitment to sustainability.\r\nOur dedication extends to every part of our operations:\r\n• Energy-efficient LED lighting across our stores\r\n• Eco-friendly, biodegradable shopping bags\r\n• Workplace practices designed to reduce waste and conserve resources\r\nIn our most ambitious step yet, we launched our first renewable energy station, now fully operational. This milestone represents a major stride forward in minimising our environmental impact and shaping a cleaner future.\r\nAt THE Group, sustainability isn’t just a goal — it’s a responsibility we proudly uphold.'),
(3759, 445, '_description', 'field_68af22f8d3da8'),
