(4943, 529, 'left_description', 'In collaboration with the Embassy of Thailand in Amman, Cozmo proudly hosted the <em>Essence of Thailand</em> — a three-day celebration of Thai culture and cuisine. Guests enjoyed live cooking at Cozmo Kitchen, authentic tastings, and a specially curated range of Thai products. As part of the event, we introduced an <strong>exclusive selection from the renowned deSIAM brand</strong>, bringing premium Thai ingredients and flavours directly to our shelves. This cultural celebration not only highlighted Thailand’s rich culinary traditions but also reinforced our commitment to offering unique global experiences to our customers in Jordan.'),
(4944, 529, '_left_description', 'field_68aefd1c9c349'),
(4945, 529, 'right_small_title', 'We Reward Loyalty'),
(4946, 529, '_right_small_title', 'field_68aefe4b9c34d'),
