(5441, 546, '_description_on_title', 'field_68af1626a75ef'),
(5442, 546, 'header_description', 'Community support is at the core of our principles\r\n'),
(5443, 546, '_header_description', 'field_68af1637a75f0'),
(5444, 546, 'main_title', 'Our Environmental Commitment'),
(5445, 546, '_main_title', 'field_68af22cbd3da7'),
(5446, 546, 'description', 'Driven by our belief that safeguarding the environment is a shared responsibility, THE Group is committed to driving positive change across all aspects of our business.\r\nOver the years, we have implemented a range of initiatives aimed at reducing our carbon footprint, championing the importance of recycling, and supporting community-focused efforts.\r\nOur journey began in 2003 with a small step: introducing a recycling programme with just three bins. A decade later, that initiative evolved into a fully operational recycling centre — a testament to our long-term commitment to sustainability.\r\nOur dedication extends to every part of our operations:\r\n• Energy-efficient LED lighting across our stores\r\n• Eco-friendly, biodegradable shopping bags\r\n• Workplace practices designed to reduce waste and conserve resources\r\nIn our most ambitious step yet, we launched our <strong>first renewable energy station</strong>, now fully operational. This milestone represents a major stride forward in minimising our environmental impact and shaping a cleaner future.\r\nAt THE Group, sustainability isn’t just a goal — it’s a responsibility we proudly uphold.'),
(5447, 546, '_description', 'field_68af22f8d3da8'),
(5448, 546, 'main_image', '127'),
(5449, 546, '_main_image', 'field_68af2319d3da9'),
(5452, 547, 'footnotes', ''),
