(5484, 549, 'first_section_title', 'Cozmo: A Story of Impeccable Quality'),
(5485, 549, '_first_section_title', 'field_68b0406e998c1'),
(5486, 549, 'first_section_description', 'Founded in 2003, Cozmo set out to redefine the shopping experience in Jordan — offering a premium supermarket built on quality, variety, and exceptional service. Today, it stands as Amman’s leading destination for everyday essentials and exclusive finds.\r\nCozmo brings together a thoughtfully selected range of local and imported products, meeting the diverse needs of our customers and constantly evolving to exceed their expectations.\r\nWith a total store space of 4,800 square metres, Cozmo offers a full-scale supermarket experience — from fresh food and grocery staples to specialty items and household necessities.\r\nCozmo is where quality, convenience, and customer care come together.'),
(5487, 549, '_first_section_description', 'field_68b04075998c2'),
