(5623, 556, 'ceo_middle_text', '<h3><strong>Dear Valued Visitor and Customer,</strong></h3>\r\n<h3>Welcome to THE Group’s new website — designed with you in mind.</h3>\r\n<h3>Rooted in Jordan and proudly serving the regional market, THE Group has grown to become a key player in the retail industry. What began as a single supermarket and fashion department store with a vision to redefine the shopping experience has evolved into a multi-brand company that caters to the everyday needs of the modern consumer.</h3>\r\n<h3>Guided by our core values — <strong>integrity, quality, excellence, passion, care, and loyalty</strong> — we remain committed to excellence across every aspect of our business.</h3>'),
(5624, 556, '_ceo_middle_text', 'field_68af075eab919'),
(5625, 556, 'ceo_last_text', '<h3>Today, THE Group encompasses a diverse portfolio of trusted brands, including:\r\n• Cozmo – Jordan’s leading premium supermarket\r\n• Cozmo Home – a refined destination for home accessories and kitchenware\r\n• Readers Bookshop – the go-to store for books, stationery, and educational tools\r\n• THE Department Store – featuring fashion brands like OVS, Piombo, Les Copains, CROFF, Pre-End, Dorina, Harmony Homewear, and Heat Holders.\r\n• Hamleys – the Finest Toy Shop in the World\r\nI invite you to explore THE Group, get to know our brands, and discover the quality and care we bring to every retail experience — both locally and across the region.</h3>'),
(5626, 556, '_ceo_last_text', 'field_68af0766ab91a'),
