(5723, 558, 'ceo_middle_text', '<h5><strong>Dear Valued Visitor and Customer,</strong></h5>\r\n<h5>Welcome to THE Group’s new website — designed with you in mind.</h5>\r\n<h5>Rooted in Jordan and proudly serving the regional market, THE Group has grown to become a key player in the retail industry. What began as a single supermarket and fashion department store with a vision to redefine the shopping experience has evolved into a multi-brand company that caters to the everyday needs of the modern consumer.</h5>\r\n<h5>Guided by our core values — <strong>integrity, quality, excellence, passion, care, and loyalty</strong> — we remain committed to excellence across every aspect of our business.</h5>'),
