(7377, 646, 'first_section_social', '2'),
(7378, 646, '_first_section_social', 'field_68b0404d998be'),
(7379, 646, 'first_section_title', 'Cozmo: A Story of Impeccable Quality'),
(7380, 646, '_first_section_title', 'field_68b0406e998c1'),
(7381, 646, 'first_section_description', 'Founded in 2003, Cozmo set out to redefine the shopping experience in Jordan — offering a premium supermarket built on quality, variety, and exceptional service. Today, it stands as Amman’s leading destination for everyday essentials and exclusive finds.\r\nCozmo brings together a thoughtfully selected range of local and imported products, meeting the diverse needs of our customers and constantly evolving to exceed their expectations.\r\nWith a total store space of 4,800 square metres, Cozmo offers a full-scale supermarket experience — from fresh food and grocery staples to specialty items and household necessities.\r\nCozmo is where quality, convenience, and customer care come together.'),
(7382, 646, '_first_section_description', 'field_68b04075998c2'),
(7383, 646, 'boxes_0_image', '629'),
(7384, 646, '_boxes_0_image', 'field_68b04081998c4'),
(7385, 646, 'boxes_0_title', 'THE Bakery'),
(7386, 646, '_boxes_0_title', 'field_68b04092998c6'),
(7387, 646, 'boxes_0_description', 'Indulge in the finest selection of freshly baked goods at THE Bakery — where Mediterranean tradition meets Western delight. From artisan breads and buttery pastries to decadent sweets, everything is made fresh daily with care and craftsmanship.\r\nWhether you\'re picking up your favourites or ordering a custom cake handcrafted by our master bakers, THE Bakery has the perfect treat for every day and every occasion.\r\nFreshly baked. Lovingly made.'),
(7388, 646, '_boxes_0_description', 'field_68b04098998c7'),
(7389, 646, 'boxes_1_image', '631'),
(7390, 646, '_boxes_1_image', 'field_68b04081998c4'),
(7391, 646, 'boxes_1_title', 'THE Butchery'),
(7392, 646, '_boxes_1_title', 'field_68b04092998c6'),
(7393, 646, 'boxes_1_description', 'Discover premium quality and unmatched freshness at THE Butchery — offering a wide selection of fresh meat, poultry, and seafood, sourced with care and precision.\r\nChoose from our prime cuts of imported beef from the US, Australia, and South Africa, or explore our range of pre-marinated, ready-to-cook options — perfect for quick, flavourful meals any day of the week.\r\nExpertly cut. Exceptionally fresh.'),
(7394, 646, '_boxes_1_description', 'field_68b04098998c7'),
(7395, 646, 'boxes_2_image', '632'),
(7396, 646, '_boxes_2_image', 'field_68b04081998c4'),
(7397, 646, 'boxes_2_title', 'THE Deli'),
(7398, 646, '_boxes_2_title', 'field_68b04092998c6'),
(7399, 646, 'boxes_2_description', 'Savour a world of flavour at THE Deli, where our hand-picked selection features the finest imported cheeses, cold cuts, smoked salmon, and a premium range of caviar.\r\nDiscover authentic tastes from across Europe — including Italy, France, Germany, the UK, the Netherlands, Switzerland, and Spain. Whether you’re assembling an elegant cheese board, indulging in delicacies, or adding something special to your everyday meals, THE Deli offers quality and variety to satisfy every taste.\r\nInternational flavours. Local convenience.'),
(7400, 646, '_boxes_2_description', 'field_68b04098998c7'),
(7401, 646, 'boxes_3_image', '633'),
(7402, 646, '_boxes_3_image', 'field_68b04081998c4'),
(7403, 646, 'boxes_3_title', 'Fresh Produce'),
(7404, 646, '_boxes_3_title', 'field_68b04092998c6'),
(7405, 646, 'boxes_3_description', 'Enjoy a vibrant selection of the freshest local and imported fruits and vegetables, available all year round. From everyday essentials to seasonal delights and a range of exotic fruits, our produce is hand-selected to ensure incomparable freshness, quality, and flavour in every bite.\r\n\r\nPicked with care. Delivered with freshness.'),
(7406, 646, '_boxes_3_description', 'field_68b04098998c7'),
(7407, 646, 'boxes', '6'),
(7408, 646, '_boxes', 'field_68b0407c998c3'),
(7409, 646, 'last_section_image', '638'),
(7410, 646, '_last_section_image', 'field_68b0408d998c5'),
(7411, 646, 'last_section_title', 'Simply Cozmo – Your Neighbourhood Gourmet Market'),
(7412, 646, '_last_section_title', 'field_68b040a6998c8'),
(7413, 646, 'last_section_description', 'Simply Cozmo is a gourmet supermarket concept designed to bring quality and convenience closer to home. Launched by THE Group in 2010 as a neighbourhood-focused expansion, it offers a curated shopping experience tailored to everyday needs.\r\n\r\nWith five branches across Amman — and a sixth opening soon — Simply Cozmo combines premium products with a warm, community-centred atmosphere, making your daily shopping simple, satisfying, and local.\r\n\r\nA gourmet supermarket serving your community.'),
(7414, 646, '_last_section_description', 'field_68b040ae998c9'),
(7415, 646, 'download_section_title', 'cozmo.jo'),
(7416, 646, '_download_section_title', 'field_68b040b4998ca'),
(7417, 646, 'download_section_description', 'In 2016, THE Group launched Jordan’s first major online grocery platform — a pioneering step that redefined convenience in the local retail landscape.\r\nThrough Cozmo.jo, customers can enjoy the same premium quality, freshness, and variety found in-store, now delivered straight to their doorstep with just a few clicks. The platform combines our years of industry expertise with seamless, user-friendly technology to create a superior online shopping experience.\r\nExceptional service. Now online.'),
(7418, 646, '_download_section_description', 'field_68b040ba998cb'),
(7419, 646, 'download_links', '2'),
(7420, 646, '_download_links', 'field_68b040c0998cc'),
(7421, 646, 'download_section_image', '637'),
(7422, 646, '_download_section_image', 'field_68b040da998cf'),
(7423, 646, 'download_links_0_store_link', 'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=jo.thegroup.cozmo&pli=1'),
(7424, 646, '_download_links_0_store_link', 'field_68b040c9998cd'),
(7425, 646, 'download_links_0_store', '167'),
(7426, 646, '_download_links_0_store', 'field_68b040d1998ce'),
(7427, 646, 'download_links_1_store_link', 'https://apps.apple.com/in/app/cozmo-jo/id1464413919'),
(7428, 646, '_download_links_1_store_link', 'field_68b040c9998cd'),
(7429, 646, 'download_links_1_store', '166'),
(7430, 646, '_download_links_1_store', 'field_68b040d1998ce'),
(7431, 646, 'brand_thumbnail', '138'),
(7432, 646, '_brand_thumbnail', 'field_68b06ab743dd3'),
(7433, 646, 'boxes_4_image', '634'),
(7434, 646, '_boxes_4_image', 'field_68b04081998c4'),
(7435, 646, 'boxes_4_title', 'Organic & Free From'),
(7436, 646, '_boxes_4_title', 'field_68b04092998c6'),
(7437, 646, 'boxes_4_description', 'Discover a thoughtfully selected range of organic, gluten-free, dairy-free, vegan, vegetarian, keto-friendly, and sugar-free products — designed to support every lifestyle and dietary need. Whether you are looking for clean-label pantry essentials or specialty items, our Organic & Free From section offers trusted brands and wholesome alternatives without compromising on taste.\r\nReal food. Pure choices.'),
(7438, 646, '_boxes_4_description', 'field_68b04098998c7'),
(7439, 646, 'boxes_5_image', '635'),
(7440, 646, '_boxes_5_image', 'field_68b04081998c4'),
(7441, 646, 'boxes_5_title', 'Cozmo at The Ritz-Carlton Residences, Amman'),
(7442, 646, '_boxes_5_title', 'field_68b04092998c6'),
(7443, 646, 'boxes_5_description', 'As part of an exclusive partnership with Al Eqbal Real Estate Development and Hotels, THE Group has established a high-end Cozmo boutique convenience store within The Ritz-Carlton Residences Amman.\r\nTailored to meet the refined lifestyle of the residents, the store offers a curated selection of everyday essentials, available for direct purchase or doorstep delivery via phone orders.\r\nIn addition, residents can coordinate with our team to arrange full household shopping deliveries from Cozmo’s larger branches — combining luxury living with effortless convenience.\r\nPersonalised service. Premium shopping at your doorstep.'),
(7444, 646, '_boxes_5_description', 'field_68b04098998c7'),
(7445, 646, 'client_logo', '425'),
(7446, 646, '_client_logo', 'field_68cff8d6db0bd'),
(7447, 647, '_wp_attached_file', '2025/08/readers.png'),
(7448, 647, '_wp_attachment_metadata', 'a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:400;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"2025/08/readers.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:2585;s:5:\"sizes\";a:2:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"readers-300x113.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:113;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:3210;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:19:\"readers-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:2309;}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),
(7451, 648, 'footnotes', ''),
(7453, 648, 'small_banner', '0'),
(7454, 648, '_small_banner', 'field_68af15bfa75ed'),
(7455, 648, 'description_on_title', '1'),
(7456, 648, '_description_on_title', 'field_68af1626a75ef'),
(7457, 648, 'header_description', 'Rewarding Loyalty Every Step of the Way\r\n\r\n'),
(7458, 648, '_header_description', 'field_68af1637a75f0'),
(7459, 648, 'main_description', 'As part of our commitment to recognising and rewarding our loyal customers, THE Group proudly presents THE Card — our exclusive loyalty programme offering valuable discounts, rewards, and partner privileges.'),
(7460, 648, '_main_description', 'field_68af2013e29f9'),
(7461, 648, 'main_image', '562'),
(7462, 648, '_main_image', 'field_68af206ee29fa'),
(7463, 648, 'points_title', 'How to Earn Points'),
(7464, 648, '_points_title', 'field_68af207ce29fb'),
(7465, 648, 'points_content', 'Earn points every time you shop across THE Group’s brands:\r\nCozmo, THE Department Store, Hamleys, Readers Bookshop, and Cozmo Home.\r\n• 1 JOD spent at Cozmo = 10 points\r\n• 1 JOD spent at all other brands = 15 points\r\nCollect 10,000 points and exchange them for vouchers redeemable at all THE Group stores.\r\n<strong>Unlock THE Gold Card</strong>\r\nReach 50,000 points to upgrade to THE Gold Card and unlock premium benefits such as:\r\n• Special privileges with our partners, including Marriott Hotels\r\n• High-value redemption opportunities across all THE Group brands'),
(7466, 648, '_points_content', 'field_68af2084e29fc'),
(7467, 648, 'other_benefits_title', 'Enjoy Exclusive Partner Benefits'),
(7468, 648, '_other_benefits_title', 'field_68af2099e29fd'),
(7469, 648, 'other_benefits_content', 'With THE Card, you unlock special offers, privileges, and discounts from our valued partners — extending your rewards beyond THE Group stores.\r\nOur partner network includes Marriott Hotels in Jordan, Khalidi Hospital, Guinot, Bertazzoni Electricals, and Al Bashiti Hardware, giving you access to exclusive benefits across hospitality, healthcare, beauty, and home essentials.\r\nIn dining, members can enjoy rewards at some of Amman’s favourite spots, including Fish Face, Bun Meats Dough, Free the Fork, Call Me Margherita, Death by Crab, and Daimeh Restaurant.\r\nTHE Card also extends to lifestyle and services through partners such as Freddy For Music, Family Taekwondo, Washy Wash, Tumayr, and Curves, ensuring your loyalty brings value to every aspect of daily life.\r\nBecause loyalty with THE Card goes further — from world-class hospitality to everyday essentials.\r\n\r\nNeed Assistance?\r\nOur team is always here to support you. Call us at 06 5501240 – Ext: 1100, and we’ll be happy to assist with any inquiries.\r\nShop. Earn. Enjoy — only with THE Card.'),
(7470, 648, '_other_benefits_content', 'field_68af20a0e29fe'),
