(7642, 657, '_first_section_social', 'field_68b0404d998be'),
(7643, 657, 'first_section_title', 'Cozmo: A Story of Impeccable Quality'),
(7644, 657, '_first_section_title', 'field_68b0406e998c1'),
(7645, 657, 'first_section_description', 'Founded in 2003, Cozmo set out to redefine the shopping experience in Jordan — offering a premium supermarket built on quality, variety, and exceptional service. Today, it stands as Amman’s leading destination for everyday essentials and exclusive finds.\r\nCozmo brings together a thoughtfully selected range of local and imported products, meeting the diverse needs of our customers and constantly evolving to exceed their expectations.\r\nWith a total store space of 4,800 square metres, Cozmo offers a full-scale supermarket experience — from fresh food and grocery staples to specialty items and household necessities.\r\nCozmo is where quality, convenience, and customer care come together.'),
(7646, 657, '_first_section_description', 'field_68b04075998c2'),
(7647, 657, 'boxes_0_image', '629'),
(7648, 657, '_boxes_0_image', 'field_68b04081998c4'),
(7649, 657, 'boxes_0_title', 'THE Bakery'),
(7650, 657, '_boxes_0_title', 'field_68b04092998c6'),
(7651, 657, 'boxes_0_description', 'Indulge in the finest selection of freshly baked goods at THE Bakery — where Mediterranean tradition meets Western delight. From artisan breads and buttery pastries to decadent sweets, everything is made fresh daily with care and craftsmanship.\r\nWhether you\'re picking up your favourites or ordering a custom cake handcrafted by our master bakers, THE Bakery has the perfect treat for every day and every occasion.\r\nFreshly baked. Lovingly made.'),
(7652, 657, '_boxes_0_description', 'field_68b04098998c7'),
(7653, 657, 'boxes_1_image', '631'),
