(7663, 657, 'boxes_2_description', 'Savour a world of flavour at THE Deli, where our hand-picked selection features the finest imported cheeses, cold cuts, smoked salmon, and a premium range of caviar.\r\nDiscover authentic tastes from across Europe — including Italy, France, Germany, the UK, the Netherlands, Switzerland, and Spain. Whether you’re assembling an elegant cheese board, indulging in delicacies, or adding something special to your everyday meals, THE Deli offers quality and variety to satisfy every taste.\r\nInternational flavours. Local convenience.'),
